{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 105, "line_no": 9, "text": "宇宙观中确有夸大人的主观能动性的倾向。", "bbox_px": {"x": 125, "y": 700, "w": 764, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "宇宙观中确有夸大人的主观能动性的倾向。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 125, "y": 700, "w": 764, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 105, "line_no": 10, "text": "布依族史诗《洪水朝天》则讲述了人类经过洪水劫难后，由善良的兄妹繁衍人类的历", "bbox_px": {"x": 205, "y": 768, "w": 1459, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "布依族史诗《洪水朝天》则讲述了人类经过洪水劫难后，由善良的兄妹繁衍人类的历", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 205, "y": 768, "w": 1459, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 105, "line_no": 11, "text": "程。《洪水潮天》中叙述：", "bbox_px": {"x": 125, "y": 833, "w": 434, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "程。《洪水潮天》中叙述：", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 125, "y": 833, "w": 434, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 105, "line_no": 12, "text": "一间房子里住得有个老者，天上的雷公想打死他，成天都在房顶上咕隆隆", "bbox_px": {"x": 281, "y": 893, "w": 1307, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "一间房子里住得有个老者，天上的雷公想打死他，成天都在房顶上咕隆隆", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 281, "y": 893, "w": 1307, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 105, "line_no": 13, "text": "的擂。", "bbox_px": {"x": 209, "y": 966, "w": 105, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "的擂。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 209, "y": 966, "w": 105, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 105, "line_no": 14, "text": "老者想：你想打死我，我也不放过你。就拿青苔铺在房顶上。青苔是滑的，", "bbox_px": {"x": 289, "y": 1030, "w": 1299, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "老者想：你想打死我，我也不放过你。就拿青苔铺在房顶上。青苔是滑的，", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 289, "y": 1030, "w": 1299, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 105, "line_no": 15, "text": "雷一打来，就滑下屋来，老者忙拿个鸡笼罩住。", "bbox_px": {"x": 209, "y": 1094, "w": 796, "h": 49}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "雷一打来，就滑下屋来，老者忙拿个鸡笼罩住。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 209, "y": 1094, "w": 796, "h": 49}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 105, "line_no": 16, "text": "有天，老者要出去，对一儿一女说：“鸡笼头那个东西，不要拿水喂。”老者走", "bbox_px": {"x": 289, "y": 1155, "w": 1295, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "有天，老者要出去，对一儿一女说：“鸡笼头那个东西，不要拿水喂。”老者走", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 289, "y": 1155, "w": 1295, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 105, "line_no": 17, "text": "后，两兄妹看着鸡笼很奇怪，里面空荡荡的，什么也没有，为哪样还喂不得水？", "bbox_px": {"x": 205, "y": 1223, "w": 1383, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "后，两兄妹看着鸡笼很奇怪，里面空荡荡的，什么也没有，为哪样还喂不得水？", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 205, "y": 1223, "w": 1383, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 105, "line_no": 18, "text": "看着看着，他们竟忘了爹的话，拿碗水放进笼里，看有什么动静。水刚放进鸡", "bbox_px": {"x": 205, "y": 1287, "w": 1379, "h": 49}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "看着看着，他们竟忘了爹的话，拿碗水放进笼里，看有什么动静。水刚放进鸡", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 205, "y": 1287, "w": 1379, "h": 49}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 105, "line_no": 19, "text": "笼，立马就不见了，笼里突然冒出个公鸡，花花绿绿的，嘴尖尖的。两兄妹更惊", "bbox_px": {"x": 209, "y": 1352, "w": 1375, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "笼，立马就不见了，笼里突然冒出个公鸡，花花绿绿的，嘴尖尖的。两兄妹更惊", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 209, "y": 1352, "w": 1375, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 105, "line_no": 20, "text": "奇了，又抬一缸水给鸡吃。公鸡吃了水，喔喔叫一声，一下挣出笼，飞上天去了。", "bbox_px": {"x": 209, "y": 1416, "w": 1367, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "奇了，又抬一缸水给鸡吃。公鸡吃了水，喔喔叫一声，一下挣出笼，飞上天去了。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 209, "y": 1416, "w": 1367, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 105, "line_no": 21, "text": "晚上，公鸡给两兄妹送来两颗革当子①，对他们说：“明天要涨大水啦。你们", "bbox_px": {"x": 289, "y": 1481, "w": 1295, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "晚上，公鸡给两兄妹送来两颗革当子①，对他们说：“明天要涨大水啦。你们", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 289, "y": 1481, "w": 1295, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 105, "line_no": 22, "text": "救了我，我也要救你们。你们赶快把这两颗革当子种下，立马就会结个大革当。", "bbox_px": {"x": 205, "y": 1545, "w": 1387, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "救了我，我也要救你们。你们赶快把这两颗革当子种下，立马就会结个大革当。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 205, "y": 1545, "w": 1387, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 105, "line_no": 23, "text": "你们把革当抠空，住进去，水就不会淹着你们了。不过，你们千万不要让你家老", "bbox_px": {"x": 209, "y": 1609, "w": 1375, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "你们把革当抠空，住进去，水就不会淹着你们了。不过，你们千万不要让你家老", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 209, "y": 1609, "w": 1375, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 105, "line_no": 24, "text": "者进去呵！”兄妹种下革当子，立马就发芽、牵藤、开花，结了个很大很大的革当。", "bbox_px": {"x": 209, "y": 1668, "w": 1384, "h": 64}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "者进去呵！”兄妹种下革当子，立马就发芽、牵藤、开花，结了个很大很大的革当。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 209, "y": 1668, "w": 1384, "h": 64}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 105, "line_no": 25, "text": "他们照雷公的话把它抠空。", "bbox_px": {"x": 209, "y": 1742, "w": 470, "h": 44}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "他们照雷公的话把它抠空。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 209, "y": 1742, "w": 470, "h": 44}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 105, "line_no": 26, "text": "突然，大雨下下来了，越下越大，天下涨了大水，两兄妹爬进革当里，见他爹", "bbox_px": {"x": 289, "y": 1806, "w": 1299, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "突然，大雨下下来了，越下越大，天下涨了大水，两兄妹爬进革当里，见他爹", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 289, "y": 1806, "w": 1299, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 105, "line_no": 27, "text": "无处躲，也把他爹接进去了。② 后来，其他人都死了，兄妹两人因葫芦而得救，结", "bbox_px": {"x": 209, "y": 1867, "w": 1375, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "无处躲，也把他爹接进去了。② 后来，其他人都死了，兄妹两人因葫芦而得救，结", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 209, "y": 1867, "w": 1375, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 105, "line_no": 28, "text": "为夫妻，并繁衍了人类。", "bbox_px": {"x": 209, "y": 1935, "w": 410, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "为夫妻，并繁衍了人类。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 209, "y": 1935, "w": 410, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 105, "line_no": 29, "text": "二、“龙造说”与布依族宇宙演化论", "bbox_px": {"x": 209, "y": 1987, "w": 599, "h": 61}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "二、“龙造说”与布依族宇宙演化论", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 209, "y": 1987, "w": 599, "h": 61}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 105, "line_no": 30, "text": "“龙造说”是布依族原始神话的一个重要内容，它认为龙神是“造天”、“造地”、“造江", "bbox_px": {"x": 201, "y": 2056, "w": 1471, "h": 60}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "“龙造说”是布依族原始神话的一个重要内容，它认为龙神是“造天”、“造地”、“造江", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 201, "y": 2056, "w": 1471, "h": 60}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 105, "line_no": 31, "text": "河”、“造田地”的善神。《祭寨龙歌》说：", "bbox_px": {"x": 125, "y": 2128, "w": 696, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "河”、“造田地”的善神。《祭寨龙歌》说：", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 125, "y": 2128, "w": 696, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 105, "line_no": 32, "text": "先辈龙王来造天，先辈龙王造辰星。天才如是明，星辰这般亮。男神造地", "bbox_px": {"x": 289, "y": 2193, "w": 1299, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "先辈龙王来造天，先辈龙王造辰星。天才如是明，星辰这般亮。男神造地", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 289, "y": 2193, "w": 1299, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
